# ╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
# │  TMUX · Zellij replica · Catppuccin Macchiato                            │
# │  Put this at: ~/.config/tmux/tmux.conf   (tmux 3.4 or newer)             │
# │  Helper scripts go in: ~/.config/tmux/script/  (chmod +x script/*)      │
# │  GENERATED by gen.py from your Zellij keybinds. Edit the output freely.  │
# ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
#
#  What you get
#    TOP BAR     tabs (left) · notifications (center) · session (right)
#    BOTTOM BAR  mode chip + live key hints (left) · Alt strip (right)
#                It is drawn in the bottom border of the bottom panes
#                (pane-border-status), because tmux has only one status line
#                per position and the top one is taken.
#    MODES       Ctrl p pane · Ctrl t tab · Ctrl n resize · Ctrl h move
#                Ctrl s scroll · Ctrl o session · Ctrl b tmux · Ctrl g lock
#    HELPERS     zextract = script/extract (needs fzf), zbuffers = script/switch
#                (needs fzf), notifications = script/notify, float = script/float.
#    PLUGINS     TPM installs tmux-resurrect and tmux-continuum on first load.
#
#  Needs: tmux >= 3.4, a Nerd Font, fzf, python3, wl-clipboard (wl-copy).
#
#  Gotchas shared with your Zellij setup
#    * Ctrl h, Ctrl n, Ctrl p, Ctrl s, Ctrl o are mode keys, so they do NOT
#      reach nvim or readline. Press Ctrl g first to lock tmux (keys pass
#      through), Ctrl g again to unlock.
#    * Ctrl h is Backspace in some terminals. Alacritty/Ghostty/kitty send
#      DEL for Backspace so it is fine; if Backspace switches to MOVE mode,
#      that is why.
#    * Alt [ and Alt ] start with the same bytes as terminal escape
#      sequences. They work in modern terminals but can feel laggy.

# ── PALETTE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Hidden variables: used as ${C_NAME} inside "double quoted" strings below.
# Catppuccin Macchiato, change a hex here and every bar follows.
%hidden C_BASE="#24273a"
%hidden C_MANTLE="#1e2030"
%hidden C_CRUST="#181926"
%hidden C_S0="#363a4f"
%hidden C_S1="#494d64"
%hidden C_S2="#5b6078"
%hidden C_O0="#6e738d"
%hidden C_TEXT="#cad3f5"
%hidden C_SUB0="#a5adcb"
%hidden C_SUB1="#b8c0e0"
%hidden C_MAUVE="#c6a0f6"
%hidden C_BLUE="#8aadf4"
%hidden C_GREEN="#a6da95"
%hidden C_PEACH="#f5a97f"
%hidden C_RED="#ed8796"
%hidden C_YELLOW="#eed49f"
%hidden C_TEAL="#8bd5ca"
%hidden C_SKY="#91d7e3"
%hidden C_LAV="#b7bdf8"
%hidden C_PINK="#f5bde6"
